# Pre-git project history (old accepted models, contractor deliveries, task packages 001-003).
# Kept on disk on purpose, deliberately out of git: ~42 MB of archives would otherwise live in
# the history forever. See docs/HISTORY_RU.md for the summary that IS versioned.
ARCHIVE/

# Orbital Economy Lab dependencies: pinned by lab/package-lock.json, installed with lab/INSTALL.cmd
lab/node_modules/

# Bench run artefacts. Shipped reports live in docs/ and are regenerated at acceptance.
lab/output/

# Local / OS noise. Logs are ignored only inside the bench: elsewhere a .log can be acceptance
# evidence (task packages shipped apply-patch.log as proof the patch was applied) and must not
# silently drop out of a commit.
lab/**/*.log
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
